id: 14
hanzi: 投篮
pinyin: tóu lán
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Verb

meanings_summary:
  en: to shoot (basketball); to shoot a hoop
  es: tirar a canasta; encestar; lanzar a la cesta

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Verb | Standard | to throw or shoot the basketball toward the hoop to score points | lanzar el balón hacia la canasta o aro para anotar puntos en baloncesto | 三分线外果断投篮 (shoot decisively from outside the three-point line)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 在全场比赛只剩最后两秒的生死关头，主力后卫顶住防守压力后仰投篮，皮球压哨空心入网。 | Zài quánchǎng bǐsài zhǐ shèng zuìhòu liǎng miǎo de shēngsǐ guāntóu, zhǔlì hòuwèi dǐngzhù fángshǒu yālì hòuyǎng tóulán, píqiú yāshào kōngxīn rùwǎng. | With merely two seconds left on the clock, the lead guard braved tight defense and sank a buzzer-beating fadeaway jumper cleanly through the net. | Con dos segundos en el marcador, el base titular desafió el marcaje y encestó en suspensión un triple limpio sobre la bocina.
  #2 | 要想显著提高比赛中的投篮命中率，运动员必须经过日复一日成千上万次肌肉记忆的强化训练。 | Yào xiǎng xiǎnzhù tígāo bǐsài zhōng de tóulán mìngzhònglǜ, yùndòngyuán bìxū jīngguò rì-fù-yírì chéngqiān-shàngwàn cì jīròu jìyì de qiánghuà xùnliàn. | To substantially improve in-game shooting accuracy, players must undergo tens of thousands of repetitions to build muscle memory day after day. | Para mejorar la eficacia de tiro en competición, los jugadores deben acumular miles de lanzamientos diarios consolidando la memoria muscular.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
